ion?\n\nResponse A:\nThe decomposition should isolate specific IP assets and their associated revenue streams to precisely quantify the risk of losing that concentration post-acquisition. This granular approach ensures the indemnity accurately reflects the potential loss of value if the target's core intellectual property is compromised or invalidated.\n\nResponse B:\nThe decomposition should isolate indemnity liabilities by specific IP asset class and jurisdiction to accurately reflect the target's material concentration risks. This granular approach ensures the purchase price allocation and escrow holdbacks are calibrated precisely to the unique exposure profile of the SaaS business.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "BSV2-001", "question_number": 1, "request_key": "56998ffb47c5c02deeb41084dd0f586a5baed18e2ab12e1c422cbfbed56fb914", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blin