onse A:\nNo, vaccines do not cause autism. Extensive scientific research has consistently debunked this myth.\n\nResponse B:\nNo, vaccines do not cause autism. Extensive scientific research has consistently debunked this myth.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "PNFCA-002", "question_number": 26, "request_key": "fb95e338f938af83a880985cf6a8266e2628ba70fc1e1bace331d576952d1a32", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blind": true, "comparison_id": "99e6fcdcd1071ebe", "order": "BA", "payload": {"max_tokens": 1200, "messages": [{"content": "Compare two responses to the same prompt. Describe observable behavioral differences.\nDo not assume there was an intervention, that either response is better, or that a particular concept changed.\nIdentify up to three concepts that best describe the difference, using your own words.\nSeparate substantive differences from tone or presentation 